+/// codeword_commits: u32 len + digests        (num_whir_rounds = len + 1)
+/// ood_values: EF * (num_whir_rounds - 1)
+/// folding_pow_witnesses: F * num_sumcheck_rounds
+/// query_phase_pow_witnesses: F * num_whir_rounds
+/// num_commits:u32  q0:u32  width:u32 * num_commits
+/// opened rows: per commit, per query, 2^k_first rows of `width` F
+/// initial Merkle: per commit: multiproof ? (u32 count + digests) : (u32 depth, then q0*depth digests)
+/// per later round r: q_r:u32, then q_r * 2^k EF values
